comment10.text=\r\n\ Checks\ if\ this\ relation\ is\ equal\ to\ another\ relation.\r\n\ \r\n\ @param\ other\ The\ other\ relation\ to\ compare\ with.\r\n\ @return\ true\ if\ both\ relations\ are\ equal,\ false\ otherwise.\r\n
